            "text": "Changelog Docs Customer stories See what&#039;s new Try GitHub Copilot AI &amp; ML AI-supported vulnerability triage with the GitHub Security Lab Taskflow Agent Learn how we are using the newly released GitHub Security Lab Taskflow Agent to triage categories of vulnerabilities in GitHub Actions and JavaScript projects."
