          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Context windows, Plan agent, and TDD: What I learned building a countdown app with GitHub Copilot"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Learn how I managed context to keep Copilot focused, used the Plan agent to sharpen vague requirements, and required Test Driven Development practices to catch bugs before users."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Building an agentic memory system for GitHub Copilot"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Copilot’s cross-agent memory system lets agents learn and improve across your development workflow, starting with coding agent, CLI, and code review."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "When protections outlive their purpose: A lesson on managing defense systems at scale"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "User feedback led us to clean up outdated mitigations. See why observability and lifecycle management are critical for defense systems."
