            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "What AI is actually good for, according to developers"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "AI is designed to help you do what you love most, not replace your expertise. Discover how developer feedback and real-world experience are shaping AI coding tools that keep you in control."
